imud-signalk (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against imud packet v12 (228 bytes).
  * Gate environment.heave on the new HEAVE_VALID flag: heave is withheld until
    the estimator settles (~10·τ), so subscribers never see the startup
    transient. (The v12 diagnostics have no standard Signal K path, so no new
    paths are emitted.)

